WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.098 --> 00:00:05.040
Speaker 1: I got dozens of emails from people&nbsp;
over the weekend, not over the weekend since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.960
last night saying, David, you've got to talk about&nbsp;
what happened at the Oscars. Will Smith open hand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:17.440
slapping a Chris Rock. And it was crazy and you've&nbsp;
got to talk about what happened. So we are going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.360
to talk about this on the bonus show today. I&nbsp;
wanted to say just a couple of things about it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:27.200
I am not. Let me first explain what happened.&nbsp;
As I understand it, and I haven't watched the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.120
Oscars in more than 10 years, but I watched&nbsp;
some clips and read some articles this morning.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:39.520
Chris Rock joked about Will Smith's wife's short&nbsp;
haircut, Jada Pinkett Smith, which is apparently&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:45.280
short, at least in part because of the&nbsp;
medical condition alopecia baldness.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:52.800
And Will Smith apparently didn't like it. And when&nbsp;
he walked up to the stage, he slapped Chris Rock.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:58.960
And then when he sat back down, he was screaming&nbsp;
at him about Keep my wife's name out of your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:05.520
mouth. The reactions exploded. Some people&nbsp;
reacting along racial lines saying that if this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:10.160
was rather than two black men, a white man and&nbsp;
a black man, it would have been seen completely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.880
different. One of them would have been arrested&nbsp;
or the other would have been arrested. OK, that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:21.360
was one line of analysis. Another was this was&nbsp;
obviously staged because in no sane world would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:26.960
this happen. And then the Oscars just. Continue.&nbsp;
I don't know that that's necessarily the case,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:31.680
the people organizing the Oscars might have been&nbsp;
as shocked by what happened as anybody else, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:34.720
they didn't know what the hell to do. And&nbsp;
they're like, I guess we just continue the show.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:43.120
I really don't know at this early point&nbsp;
in time what the truth is about this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:50.080
but it is one of the strangest things I've&nbsp;
ever even heard of happening during the Oscars,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:53.520
and we are going to talk about it in more&nbsp;
detail on the bonus show. So I just wanted to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:57.040
say a little something I want to hear from you.&nbsp;
If you're watching on YouTube, leave a comment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:02.720
